## Interface: 16001
## Title: Guidelime |cff66ff66Forever Shaman 1-30|r
## Notes: Braedyn's Alliance levelling route for WoW Forever - Dwarf Shaman and Dwarf/Human Hunter, class and race steps filtered automatically. 1-20: Eastern Kingdoms, Hall of Thanes + Deadmines (24-25 Sep 2026, audited 17 Oct against QuestieDB Forever 1.0.6). 20-30 (18 Oct 2026): Ruins of Lordaeron, Loch Modan, Redridge, Darkshore, Ashenvale + Blackfathom Deeps, Duskwood, the Stockade, Wetlands, Darnassus, Excavation Site, Hillsbrad, Gnomeregan, Razorfen Kraul - every Alliance dungeon quest in the bracket, Call of Water and Call of Air for the shaman. 25 Oct: launch-crowd layer in 1-15, Call of Water finale moved to Westfall, shaman fixes, Dalaran lead-ins carried from 15/23. 27 Oct: cooking + fishing layer (Longjaw Mud Snapper and Mithril Head Trout food plan, Journeyman/Expert steps, fish-to-N stops, Seasoned Wolf Kabobs), drop-rate pass (Never Saddle on Quality retargeted to Elder Snow Leopards; Show of Force, The Quarry's Smith and Slowing the Orc Advance dropped; kill budgets and one-kill notes). 28 Oct: Cooking-175 steps (Hot Spices at Menethil, cook omelets to 175 at Whelgar) so the Mithril Head Trout opens at 29-30; [TAR] tags on the Minor Manifestation of Earth, Kernobee and Willix. 29 Oct: First Aid thread (bandage-to-N stops at 20/50/75/100/125; Heavy Linen 40 and Journeyman at Nissa Firestone, Wool 80 at Michelle Belle, Heavy Wool 115 at Fremal Doohickey, Expert book at Deneb Walker in Stromgarde on the Call of Air leg - recipe values from the Wowhead Forever spell pages). 1 Nov: Alba's Westfall chain reordered to its QuestieDB 1.0.9 prerequisites (The State of the Mines after the well and gill hand-ins, the Moonbrook crates and the Stormwind explosives chain on the Deadmines trip, one run), Harvesting the Harvesters item-start fixed, Blackrock Blockade made a plain step and handed in before Shadow Magic and Tharil'zun, Alther's Mill left to chapter 10, Holy Diver dropped (0 XP, needs all nine beached quests). Gear calls rescored on the 1 Nov tooltips: thirteen quoted stats corrected (Deepgrave Trousers, Ironforge Greathammer, Rockslicer, Flamefist Grips, Bravo's Armbands and others changed in the October builds); Frontier Britches and Smith's Trousers now replace Deepgrave, Staff of Westfall over the Greathammer when no Deadmines 2H drops, Boots of the People's Militia over statless boots, Garb of Florid Feathers over Raptorbane; roll-if-it-drops notes for Blackened Defias Leggings, Bloodied Chestwraps, Witherbite Bracers and the Electrocutioner Lagnut. Wowhead XP refreshed for all 21 zones; six quoted XP figures corrected (Fishin' Time 680, The Powers Below 1,700, Ira's Dagger 2,000, Gleaming Crescent Necklace 1,600, Mor'Ladim 2,750). 1 Nov (evening): Leatherworking after the 31 Oct hotfix - the Totemic Leather Armor / Pants patterns (no Pristine Leather, tradeable dungeon drops) are now an AH check at every city and merchant-camp pass (07, 10, 15, 16) with the early switch in 07; profession notes in 1-6 and chapter 06 updated. 1 Nov (late): Cozy Sleeping Bag chain - ... and that note you found picked up at Alexston Farmstead (05), handed in and Stepping Stones taken at the burnt tower south of Taurajo on the Kraul ride (26), carried to 30-40. 1 Nov (night): Making Do - Expanding Horizons taken at Thundris in Auberdine (11), handed to Baros Alexston with Making Do taken on the Stockade trip (15), handed in at Thundris on the Darnassus trip (20) for the Shipwright's Satchel, a 6-slot reagent bag. 1 Nov (night, 2): Captain Sanders treasure hunt as [O] steps on the Westfall south loop (05: map from the Longshore murlocs, footlocker west of the quarry, barrel east of Alexston Farmstead, jug by the windmill, chest on the north-west coast; Booty Bag 8-slot and Captain Sander's Locker); chapter 07 note trimmed. 1 Nov (rename): addon renamed from Guidelime_ForeverAlliance to Guidelime_ForeverShaman (group "Forever Shaman 1-30") - delete the old folder if you had it. 1 Nov (release check): the Mor'Ladim chain total in 25-26 corrected to 5,340 XP; Darnassus, Razorfen Kraul and Gnomeregan XP refreshed from Wowhead (every route zone is now on 1 Nov data); a quoted-XP check added to the tooling. 2 Nov: QuestieDB 1.0.10 and client build 1.60.1.70753 - the DB now carries NPC ranks: Incinerator Gar'im (16) and Baron Marinous (11, now GROUP 2+) noted as elite, Giant Wetlands Crocolisk spawn count 19 (18); Wowhead XP re-pulled for every route zone (no XP change). 2 Nov (night): 19-20 Deadmines now rebinds the hearth at Sentinel Hill (Redridge had bound it at Lakeshire and 07-10 hearthed to Sentinel Hill); a hearth-bind check added to check_guide.
## Author: Braedyn (with Claude)
